          {
           "id": "52034d5c",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p class=\"lead fade-up\">At Newman Air (formerly Best in Show Heating &amp; Cooling), comfort isn’t just our business—it’s in our roots. For more than 30 years, we’ve proudly served the Tri-Cities, TN, area as a family-operated company built on honesty, reliability and skilled craftsmanship. What started as a local business with big ambitions has grown into a trusted team that treats every customer like a neighbor. From day one, we’ve focused on doing the right thing, keeping our promises and delivering service that feels less like a transaction and more like a helping hand.</p>"
           },
           "elements": [],
           "isInner": true,
           "widgetType": "text-editor",
           "elType": "widget"
